{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryFilter"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A filter can require component types, exclude them, require components added or changed since"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a tick, and require a relation to a target. Filters read nothing: an entity’s components decide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whether it passes, but a query’s rows carry only the values of its terms."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build a filter from a static method such as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/with(_:)-swift.type.method"},{"type":"text","text":" and refine it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the instance methods of the same names. Each method returns a new filter that an entity passes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only if it meets every condition. To pass entities that meet at least one of several filters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/anyOf(_:)-swift.type.method"},{"type":"text","text":", so you can write any condition on which component types an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity holds:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"drifter\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"statue\"), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"ghost\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"rock\"))","","let moving = QueryFilter.with(Velocity.self).without(Frozen.self)","let movingOrFrozen = QueryFilter.anyOf(.with(Velocity.self), .with(Frozen.self))","","let movingNames = world.query(Name.self).filtered(by: moving).map { $0.1.value }","print(movingNames)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"drifter\"]\"","","let movingOrFrozenNames = world.query(Name.self).filtered(by: movingOrFrozen).map { $0.1.value }","print(movingOrFrozenNames)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"drifter\", \"statue\", \"ghost\"]\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass a filter to "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/init(filter:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", to "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/filtered(by:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", or as the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"argument of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update(_:reading:where:body:)"},{"type":"text","text":". Queries, views and updates also offer the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"methods directly, so you can write "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Query(Name.self).without(Frozen.self)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Filtering Queries","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/FilterTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/With","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Without","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Added","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Changed","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Allows"],"anchor":"Filtering-Queries"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter","inte